        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 16A5SS, Stainless Steel 1-1/2 x 11 Rectangular Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Below Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 x 11 Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Handleset features Emtek's door configuration number 6, which has an American Cylinder below the lever and 3-5/8 inch centers. It is made to fit Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6 is available with your choice of contemporary lever. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Door-configuration-6-specifcations.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"186\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek Configuation #6 Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn (for Keyed, Passage, and Patio Functions): 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-1.x11-config-6-specificaion.pdf?v=1704262361\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 16A5SS Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Active (inside):</b> Active lever inside with fixed inactive lever outside. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Inactive:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Patio:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) interior thumb turn and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 x 11 Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Handleset",
                "description": "The 1-1/2 x 11 Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Handleset features Emtek's door configuration number 6, which has an American Cylinder below the lever and 3-5/8 inch centers. It is made to fit Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6 is available with your choice of contemporary lever. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.",
                "keywords": "Stainless Steel Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6, Stainless Steel Modern Configuration 6 Patio Trims, Modern 1-1/2 x 11 Multi Point Handlesets, Emtek 16A5SS, Emtek 16A1SS, Emtek 16A3SS, Emtek 16A4SS, Emtek 16A2SS, EMT-16A5SS, Rectangular Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Below Handle, contemporary patio door locks, modern patio door locks, american cylinder multipoint trim sets, American cylinder below levers, American profile cylinder locksets, Milgard Multi Point Trim replacements, Pella Multi Point Trim replacements,"
